Package: Precious.metals
Title: Forecast Precious Metals Prices with ARIMA
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: person("Enrique", "Pérez Herrero",
                  email = "eph.project1500@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Enrique Pérez Herrero [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Enrique Pérez Herrero <eph.project1500@gmail.com>
Description: A Shiny application that downloads the last 180 days of gold,
    silver, palladium, and platinum prices from Oanda and forecasts the next
    90 days using the auto.arima() function from the forecast package.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
License: file LICENSE
